			"notes": "## Changed\n- Updated for **Minecraft 26.3** (Fabric Loader 0.19.5+ / Fabric API 0.161.0+; NeoForge `26.3.0.7-beta`+). Requires Minecraft 26.3.\n\n## Fixed\n- **Jade no longer wipes your selected resource packs.** With Jade installed, Wireless Redstone's tooltip plugin was missing two config-screen translations; Jade flagged that on the title screen and the game responded by deselecting every resource pack, on every launch. The translations are now included.\n- Ported to the 26.3 APIs: block codecs (removed from the game), the renamed piston push-reaction constants, and the 26.3 resource/data pack formats.\n\n## Notes\n- NeoForge for 26.3 is still in **beta**; this build targets `26.3.0.7-beta`.\n- No world or config changes; existing transmitters, receivers, and pairings carry over."
		},
